<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, six rose and six were flat in 24.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,801.5 points, 1.3 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.9 percent in a 28.8-million zloty-turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
